  "jei.nanonaitor_forged_armor.armor_forge": "Place armor and an attachment to forge them together. A position that is already filled is swapped and the old attachment comes back to you. Place armor on its own to remove all of its attachments.",
  "guide.nanonaitor_forged_armor.intro.1": "Forged Armor\n\nMobs sometimes drop trophies: horns, hearts, wings, tails and more. Forge them onto armor to give it new powers.\n\nEach armor piece has two attachment positions.",
  "guide.nanonaitor_forged_armor.intro.2": "The Armor Forge\n\nCraft it from three Oxidized Copper over four Iron Blocks.\n\nArmor + attachment = forged armor. Filling a taken position swaps it and returns the old part.\n\nArmor alone removes every attachment and gives them back.",
  "guide.nanonaitor_forged_armor.intro.3": "Tips\n\nForged armor shows a green gem per attachment in your inventory.\n\nShulker Shell: press G for your Ender Chest.\n\nBreeze Wind: double-tap a movement key to dash.\n\nAllay and Vex Wings: jump again in mid-air."
